# Sales Analytics Dashboard — Internship Task 2

Professional Sales Analytics project completed as part of the **Sumerix Global Data Science Internship**.

**Student:** Naushad Malik  
**Degree:** B.E./B.Tech. in Computer Engineering

## Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing sales data using **Python, SQL, PostgreSQL, and Power BI** to identify sales trends, customer behavior, regional performance, product performance, profitability, and business insights.

## Objectives

- Analyze overall sales, profit, orders, and quantity.
- Compare performance across categories, regions, and customer segments.
- Analyze customer and product performance.
- Study monthly, quarterly, and yearly sales trends.
- Perform data analysis using Python and SQL.
- Store and analyze data using PostgreSQL.
- Create a professional Power BI dashboard.

## Dataset

The project uses a cleaned sales dataset containing transactional information.

